    step("非法返回值的 TypeError 原文:None →「The view function for None did not return a valid response. The function either returned None or ended without a return statement.」(这里直接调用 app.make_response,没有端点所以写的是 None);int、set、dataclass →「The view function did not return a valid response. The return type must be a string, dict, list, tuple with headers or status, Response instance, or WSGI callable, but it was a int/set/P.」;4 元素元组 →「The view function did not return a valid response tuple. The tuple must have the form (body, status, headers), (body, status), or (body, headers).」。", t=tl(S(2)), mark=lidx(S(2), 'None:', 'int:', 'tuple 长度 4:', 'set:', 'dataclass:'), kv=KV([['None', 'returned None or ended without a return statement'], ['int / set / dataclass', 'The return type must be a string, dict, list, tuple…'], ['4 元组', 'must have the form (body, status, headers)…']], ['None'])),
